    "title": "Privacy Policy",
    "s1_h": "Summary",
    "s1_p": "MnemoCard is local-first: your decks, progress and settings stay in your browser.",
    "s2_h": "What is stored",
    "s2_p": "Your review history, preferences, pinned decks and language choice are stored in your browser. Decks you create while signed in with Google are stored in Google Cloud Firestore so anyone can browse and study them, while only your account can edit or delete them.",
